        (`send_with`); the leaver's drain runs on while `pending`, less
        what it has received, is above 0 (`awaiting_handoffs`); a worker
        that has left passes what its channel delivers on to a sibling
        that has not (`forward`, `pick_for_leaver`), admitting it only when
        none is left; and the drain's tail retires what the shutdown took
